msgid ""
"A handful of small, water-soluble white crystals with a watery metallic odor,"
" historically used for many different purposes.  Also known as potash alum "
"and potassium aluminum sulfate; often called simply alum, as it's the most "
"important member of the generic class of compounds called alums."
msgstr ""

